# Branches in this repo that are entered only by a pull request the owner merges,
# in addition to the driver default (develop main master).
#
# Added 2026-08-12, with the Vercel production-branch change that created it.
# A push to `release` IS a production deployment - it is the most consequential
# ref in the repo, and back when this file listed four branch roles it was the
# only one of them that nothing refused. The decoupling only buys anything if
# promotion stays a deliberate act, and an unguarded branch that deploys on push
# is the coupling reintroduced under a new name.
release

# `rebuild/v1` was listed here from 2026-08-12 to 2026-08-27, back when it was
